### SW1

enable
configure terminal
hostname SW1
enable secret class

line vty 0 4
password 1234
login
exit

interface vlan 1
ip address 192.168.1.201 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

end
copy running-config startup-config


### SW2


enable
configure terminal
hostname SW2
enable secret class

line vty 0 4
password 1234
login
exit

interface vlan 1
ip address 192.168.1.203 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

end
copy running-config startup-config


### From PC

Connect to SW1:

PC1> telnet 192.168.1.201
Password: 1234


Connect to SW2:


PC2> telnet 192.168.1.203
Password: 1234


### IP Addressing


SW1 → 192.168.1.201/24
SW2 → 192.168.1.203/24
PC1 → 192.168.1.2/24
PC2 → 192.168.1.3/24

